on</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>G&#x000fc;rtler</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Spatial structuring of <italic>Triatoma infestans</italic> (Hemiptera Reduviidae) populations from Northwestern Argentina using wing morphometry.</article-title><source>J Med Entomol</source><volume>42</volume><fpage>643</fpage><lpage>649</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15311455</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000202-Cecer1"><label>35</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cecer&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Vasquez-Prokopec</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>G&#x000fc;rtler</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kitron</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Reinfestation sources for Chagas disease vector, <italic>Triatoma infestans</italic>, Argentina.</article-title><source>Emerg Infect Dis</source><volume>12</volume><fpage>1096</fpage><lpage>1102</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16836826</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000202-Instituto1"><label>36</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Instituto Nacional de Estad&#x000ed;stica</collab><year>1993</year><source>Censo Nacional de Poblaci&#x000f3;n y Vivienda 1992: Resultados Finales</source><publisher-loc>La Paz, Bolivia</publisher-loc><publisher-name>INE</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000202-VazquezProkopec1"><label>37</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vazquez-Prokopec</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ceballos</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kitron</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>G&#x000fc;rtler</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><